(   'C'\) are placed adjacent to the arrowheads, readable in the normal sheet viewing orientation.) Tj
T*
(   - Section Title: The resulting sectional view is explicitly titled directly above or below the) Tj
T*
(   view: 'SECTION A-A' or 'SECTION B-B'.) Tj
T*
(   - If multiple cutting planes exist on a single drawing, letters are assigned sequentially \(A-A,) Tj
T*
(   B-B, C-C, avoiding confusing letters like I, O, Q, X\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
