T*
(   4. Exception \(Transverse Cutting Planes\):) Tj
T*
(   If the cutting plane passes TRANSVERSELY \(crosswise / perpendicular to the axis\) through a) Tj
T*
(   shaft, bolt, key, or rib, the exposed cross-section MUST BE HATCHED normally.) Tj
T*
