(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the command sequence and drafting steps in AutoCAD to create a Half-Sectional Front View of a stepped flange bushing \(Bore 40 mm, Hub 70 mm, Flange 120 mm\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   AutoCAD Command Sequence:) Tj
T*
(   1. Setup Coordinate Datum & Centerlines:) Tj
T*
(   - Switch to layer 'CENTER' \(Red, 0.25 mm, CENTER\). Turn on Ortho \(F8\).) Tj
T*
(   - Command: LINE -> Start: 50,150 -> Next: @160<0 [Enter] \(Horizontal axis\).) Tj
T*
(   - Command: LINE -> Start: 130,90 -> Next: @120<90 [Enter] \(Vertical symmetry axis\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Draw Left Half \(Unsectioned External Elevation\):) Tj
T*
(   - Switch to layer 'VISIBLE' \(Blue, 0.50 mm, Continuous\).) Tj
T*
(   - Flange left outer boundary: Command: LINE -> From \(130, 210\) to \(70, 210\) -> down to \(70,) Tj
T*
(   190\) -> to \(95, 190\) -> down to \(95, 150\).) Tj
T*
(   - Mirror across horizontal axis to form lower left external half:) Tj
T*
(   Command: MIRROR -> Select drawn left lines -> Mirror line: \(50,150\) to \(130,150\) -> Erase) Tj
T*
(   source: No.) Tj
T*
(   - The left half displays the external cylindrical steps \(120 mm flange, 70 mm hub\) without any) Tj
T*
(   hidden lines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Draw Right Half \(Sectioned Internal Profile\):) Tj
T*
(   - Switch to layer 'VISIBLE'.) Tj
T*
(   - Draw cut wall profile from vertical centerline \(X = 130\):) Tj
T*
(   * Bore wall: From \(130, 170\) to \(190, 170\) [Radius = 20 mm, Bore = 40 mm].) Tj
T*
(   * Hub outer wall: From \(190, 170\) to \(190, 185\) -> to \(165, 185\) [Hub Radius = 35 mm].) Tj
T*
(   * Flange wall: From \(165, 185\) to \(165, 210\) -> to \(130, 210\) [Flange Radius = 60 mm].) Tj
T*
(   - Mirror upper right cut profile across horizontal axis to lower right half.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Apply Hatching to Sectioned Right Half:) Tj
T*
(   - Switch to layer 'HATCH' \(0.25 mm\).) Tj
T*
(   - Command: HATCH [Enter] -> Pattern: ANSI31 -> Angle: 0 -> Scale: 1.0.) Tj
T*
(   - Click inside upper right cut wall and lower right cut wall.) Tj
T*
(   - The dividing line between left and right halves is the VERTICAL CHAIN CENTERLINE at X = 130.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Dimensioning:) Tj
T*
(   - Command: DIMLINEAR -> Dimension external flange length on left.) Tj
T*
(   - Dimension bore 'phi 40' on right using a single-arrowhead leader crossing the centerline.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
