T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Assembly Sectioning Methodology in AutoCAD:) Tj
T*
(   - In mechanical CAD, assembly drawings represent multiple mating components operating together.) Tj
T*
(   - Layer Organization:) Tj
T*
(   * Assign dedicated layers to different functional subsystems or use a unified 'HATCH_PART1',) Tj
T*
(   'HATCH_PART2' structure.) Tj
